1
00:00:00,981 --> 00:00:03,231
(Penny:)Hey, I happen to love this movie.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,980
(Howard:)Fine. Let's watch it.

3
00:00:05,611 --> 00:00:08,741
(Howard:)Maybe all our periods will synchronize.

4
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,250
(Sheldon:)We're going to be
designing an experiment...

5
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:19,582
(Sheldon:)...to look for the annihilation spectrum
resulting from dark-matter collisions.

6
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:23,500
(Raj:)Ooh, dark matter.
We better bring a flashlight, ha, ha.

7
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:27,260
(Raj:)I was making a joke.

8
00:00:27,424 --> 00:00:30,764
(Sheldon:)I'm the boss. I make the jokes.

9
00:00:32,012 --> 00:00:33,972
(Raj:)Sorry. Go ahead and make your joke.

10
00:00:34,139 --> 00:00:36,269
(Sheldon:)This is not the time for joking.

11
00:00:36,809 --> 00:00:40,479
(Sheldon:)We're doing serious research
which requires complete and utter focus.

12
00:00:40,646 --> 00:01:13,036
(Raj:)All right. Let's buckle down and work.

